; BOSS off vs on, at a difficulty where the strongest never turns up by itself
generate crypt width:48 height:48 path:8 branches:2 branchmin:1 branchmax:2 loops:0 winding:0 irregular:0 deadends:0 difficulty:0.2 ramp:0 boss:0 reward:0.5 seed:33 locks:0
generate crypt width:48 height:48 path:8 branches:2 branchmin:1 branchmax:2 loops:0 winding:0 irregular:0 deadends:0 difficulty:0.2 ramp:0 boss:1 reward:0.5 seed:33 locks:0
validate
savemap
